Sailor Moon

423
00:23:33,187 --> 00:23:37,434
Moon Buster

424
00:23:37,474 --> 00:23:38,515
Klutz

425
00:23:38,636 --> 00:23:39,556
Ray

426
00:23:39,998 --> 00:23:41,519
Shocking Kick

427
00:23:42,121 --> 00:23:42,801
好

428
00:23:42,843 --> 00:23:44,965
咁就銀彈一關開啓

